lines = ["It looks like you got knocked out.", "Don't worry, it's not the end of the world, you've still got some time left to finish your task.", 
"Though it looks like you're pretty beat up.", "You'll need some time to rest, you're probably going to be late for work tomorrow.", 
"You probably also dropped some pocket change, so don't be suprised if some of your money is missing.", 
"Try to be more careful in the future, dock early if you're getting low and buy medical supplies from the shop.", 
"Remember this advice, I won't remind you again."];
i = 0;
text = lines[i];
